      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which standards apply to electro-medical equipment?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "ISO 13485 for the manufacturing site's quality system, and the IEC 60601 series for electrical safety, with the specific parts depending on the device type."
